Z||000000||Makaio13||04-22-2001||02:50 AM||||I know there is a total difference between racing a Saab 9000 CS and racing my 85 Fiero GT but my Fiero unfortunately is not street legal due to tags.  I still drive it just to keep "her" happy but you really can't do very much.  But tonight I raced a friend of mine's Saab 9000 CS against a BMW 325i.  Just practicing the shifting process in a heated red light green light race on Route 30PA.  It was a good race...lucky for me cars protruded the BMW's path and I got away.  But this is just a preface for the many chapters that my 85 Fiero GT and I will bring to this forum.||||reg||10
